Even Better Sidebar is a modified copy of Better Sidebar 3.7.0 from
https://github.com/munza/herdr-mods (Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE).

Changes (2026-11-23): renamed; Claude Code sessions read from their transcripts on
every machine (scan.cjs, views/claude.js) add context %, time since the last reply
against the prompt cache, and the subagent tree (tree.js) under each agent; Claude
terminals Herdr doesn't list as agents show too; spinners replaced by a pulsing dot;
pinned spaces (pin beside the title) keep their slot after closing and can be dragged like
open ones (order.js); closed ones go to Recently closed (views/places.js). Machine headers show Claude's weekly
pace ("31% [W]") from the quota mod's shared "quota.pace:<machine>".

The hourglass icons (icons/hourglass-*.svg) draw sand into the outline of Tabler
Icons' hourglass (https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2020-2024 Paweł Kuna). The other added icons are from Lucide
(https://lucide.dev, ISC License).

